  description: 'Trigger: On combat draw beyond full hand

    Condition: Combat active;
    Rare Overflow owned; root player action has remaining budget

    Effect: Automatically
    play each overflow card as a normal single-card action; target current valid
    selected enemy, otherwise first living enemy in encounter order. Outside combat,
    draw normally.

    Value: No extra action cost

    Limit: Up to 3 per root
    player action; nested draws share budget'
